  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Empowering the Poorest by Building Homes</narrative>
  </title>
  <description>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">WOW Tanzania aims to provide affordable housing for impoverished widows with children, orphans, street children, and single-parent families in need. With a brick making machine, we&apos;ll create cost-effective, resilient homes while empowering the community through skill training. This project will enhance lives, promote sustainability, and foster a sense of community.  Together, we&apos;re building a brighter future for the most vulnerable in one of the poorest countries in the world!</narrative>
  </description>
